amidi -l : list all midi ports


note on/off command example
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "90 3C 7F"
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "80 3C 7F"	

control change command example
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "B0 00 00"	
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "B0 01 01"	
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "B0 02 02"	
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "B0 03 03"	

program change command example
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "C0 04"	
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "C7 08"	

poly pressure command example
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "A0 3C 7F"
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "A0 48 7F"	

pitch bend command example
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "E0 21 7F"
amidi -p hw:1,0 -S "E0 37 7F"	

sysex command example
amidi -p hw:1,0,0 -S 'F0 30 55 55 F7'
						  |  |  |
						  |  |  ---------------------------------	reset
						  |  ------------------------------------	reset
						  ---------------------------------------	system command cmd

amidi -p hw:1,0,0 -S 'F0 30 22 00 F7' -r dump.syx -t 1
						  |  |  |  
						  |  |  ---------------------------------	program number
						  |  ------------------------------------	dump program
						  ---------------------------------------	system command cmd
						  
